  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development to which this permission relates must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of the decision notice.\r\rReason: To comply with the provisions of S.51 of the Planning & Compulsory Purchase Act 2004.\r",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans: \r\r8059-SMR-00-ZZ-DR-A-2001-S4-P3\r8059-SMR-SI-ZZ-DR-A-2002-S4-P7\r8059-SMR-SI-ZZ-DR-A-2016-S2-P5\r8059-SMR-00-ZZ-DR-A-2004-S4-P6\r8059-SMR-SI-ZZ-DR-A-2003-S4-P11\r8059-SMR-00-ZZ-DR-A-2005-S4-P9\r8059-SMR-SI-ZZ-DR-A-2015-S2-P7\r8059-SMR-00-ZZ-DR-A-2017-S4-P5\r8059-SMR-SI-ZZ-DR-A-2018-S2-P4\r\rReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning.\r",
    "The external finishing materials shall match those used in the construction of the existing building and/or areas of hard surfacing. \r\rReason: To ensure a satisfactory appearance\r",
    "Noise levels at a point 1 metre external to sensitive facades shall be at least 5dB(A) less than the existing background measurement (LA90), expressed in dB(A) when all plant/equipment (or any part of it) is in operation unless the plant/equipment hereby permitted will have a noise that has a distinguishable, discrete continuous note (whine, hiss, screech, hum) and/or if there are distinct impulses (bangs, clicks, clatters, thumps), then the noise levels from that piece of plant/equipment at any sensitive façade shall be at least 10dB(A) below the LA90, expressed in dB(A).\r\rReason: To safeguard the amenities of the adjoining premises and the area generally\r"
  ],
